From: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:21:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 97/97] goodix-fp-overlay: sensor light and lock screen for
 Plasma Mobile

The OnePlus 8 Pro's optical fingerprint sensor only sees a finger that the
display lights up. Under KWin the driver's framebuffer drawing is not shown,
so this session helper draws the ring and the white disk from fprintd's
finger-needed/finger-present properties on a layer-shell overlay surface,
marked with kde_lockscreen_overlay_v1 so it also shows over the lock screen.

It also adds /etc/pam.d/fingerprint-auth and /etc/pam.d/postlogin, which
kscreenlocker's kde-fingerprint service includes but nothing provides.
